  "motionReadabilityNotes": {
    "celestial_palm": "PASS - Reads as a compact palm burst. Energy sits in the palm/strike zone, though the burst sprite is visibly separated a few pixels in the strongest frames; acceptable as embedded strike impact, not a free projectile row.",
    "ascend_step": "PASS WITH NOTES - Reads as a fast rush special/gap closer. Cyan trail reinforces forward speed but is the boldest effect language on the sheet.",
    "heaven_splitter": "PASS - Clearly moves upward with rising body/arm beats and contained vertical energy.",
    "divine_vanish": "NEEDS REVIEW - Reads as vanish/reposition, but the transparency/afterimage frames are visually busy and could confuse runtime readability. This is the main correction candidate if Sheet 5 needs polish.",
    "radiant_dive": "PASS - Reads as an air dive special with downward strike beats and attached impact accent.",
    "special_recovery": "PASS - Settles back toward neutral/recovery cleanly.",
    "kiAttachment": "PASS WITH NOTES - Cyan/gold effects stay in each source cell and do not bleed; some impact bursts are visually offset from the palm, so treat them as embedded hit accents rather than separate runtime overlays.",
    "locsAndCloak": "PASS - Locs remain hair only; cloak remains contained and readable through the sequences."
  },
